** collapses runs of other characters into one dash and strips edge dashes. Digits are kept. Underscores and non-ASCII letters (`café` becomes `caf`) are treated as separators.\n- **`truncate`:** covers short text, text exactly at the limit, and custom or empty suffixes. It also checks that trailing spaces before the suffix are dropped and that the result never exceeds the limit. A limit shorter than the suffix raises `ValueError`, even when the text is short.\n- **`title_case`:** small words stay lowercase unless first, and other words are title-cased. Input case is normalised, whitespace collapsed, and empty input handled.\n- **`is_palindrome`:** ignores case, spaces and punctuation, counts digits, and treats empty or symbols-only text as a palindrome.\n- **`chunk`:** covers even and uneven splits, a size larger than the list, an empty list, and input that must not be mutated. It also works on strings, and a size below 1 raises `ValueError`.\n- **`most_common`:** ranks by count with alphabetical ties, ignoring case and punctuation. It also covers apostrophes inside words, digits splitting words, `n` larger than the number of words, `n=0`, and empty text.\n\nThe tests also record some behaviour that may surprise you, which you might want to change later:\n- `slugify` drops accented letters.\n- `truncate` raises on a too-small limit even when the text would fit.\n- `most_common` counts a lone `'` as a word.\n\nThe tests add the repo root to `sys.path`, so they work from any directory.","ttft_ms":1501,"type":"result","duration_ms":34878,"uuid":"df1a3d3f-1804-48f2-a915-d159c2712abc","ttft_stream_ms":663,"time_to_request_ms":57,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":14,"system_prompt":12,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":1,"input_attachments":7,"input_hooks":2,"tool_pool_refresh":1,"init_message":2,"engine_pickup":1,"autocompact":1,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":7,"message_normalization":1,"client_creation":3,"request_build":5},"turn_start_resume